{"id":"H5677","lemma":"עֵ֫בֶר","transliteration":"ever","sayIt":"E-ver","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Eber","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.10.21;\nson of: Shelah (H7974);\nfather of: Peleg (H6389) and Joktan (H3355)\nAlso named: Eber (Ἐβέρ \"Eber\" G1443)\n§ Eber or Heber = \"the region beyond\"\n1) son of Salah, great grandson of Shem, father of Peleg and Joktan\n2) a Gadite chief\n3) a Benjamite, son of Elpaal and descendant of Sharahaim\n4) a Benjamite, son of Shashak\n5) a priest in the days of Joiakim the son of Jeshua","glosses":["eber","when eber"],"count":15,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-10","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Eber","kjv":"of Eber"}},{"chapterId":"gen-10","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"gen-10","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Eber","kjv":"And unto Eber"}},{"chapterId":"gen-11","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"gen-11","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber","kjv":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"gen-11","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Eber","kjv":"And Eber"}},{"chapterId":"gen-11","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber","kjv":"And Eber"}},{"chapterId":"num-24","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Eber","kjv":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber","kjv":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Eber","kjv":"And unto Eber"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber","kjv":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Eber","kjv":"and Heber"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber","kjv":"Eber"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber","kjv":"and Heber"}},{"chapterId":"neh-12","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eber"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 10:21","note":"Children were also born to Shem (the elder brother of Japheth), the father of all the children of Eber.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 24:24","note":"But ships shall come from the coast of Kittim. They shall afflict Asshur, and shall afflict Eber. He also shall come to destruction.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:18","note":"Arpachshad became the father of Shelah, and Shelah became the father of Eber.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 12:20","note":"of Sallai, Kallai; of Amok, Eber;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H4918","lemma":"מְשֻׁלָּם","transliteration":"meshullam","gloss":"Meshullam"},{"id":"H0032","lemma":"אֲבִיחַ֫יִל","transliteration":"avihayil","gloss":"Abihail"},{"id":"H0447","lemma":"אֱלִיאֵל","transliteration":"eliel","gloss":"Eliel"},{"id":"H0508","lemma":"אֶלְפַּ֫עַל","transliteration":"elpaal","gloss":"Elpaal"},{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","gloss":"Beriah"},{"id":"H2069","lemma":"זְבַדְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zevadyah","gloss":"Zebadiah"},{"id":"H2127","lemma":"זִיעַ","transliteration":"zia","gloss":"Zia"},{"id":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","transliteration":"zikhri","gloss":"Zichri"}],"senses":[{"id":"H5677H","gloss":"Eber","relation":"H5677H ="},{"id":"H5677I","gloss":"Eber","relation":"H5677I ="},{"id":"H5677J","gloss":"Eber","relation":"H5677J ="},{"id":"H5677K","gloss":"Eber","relation":"H5677K ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}